Neovim Tutor: 03 SEARCH

Goal
  Find and replace quickly.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Search
  /pattern    search forward
  ?pattern    search backward
  n           next match
  N           previous match

Practice:
  - Search for the word "Lesson" with /Lesson.
  - Jump through matches with n and N.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Search settings
  :set hlsearch    highlight matches
  :set nohlsearch  disable highlight
  :set incsearch   show match while typing

Practice:
  - Toggle :set hlsearch and :set nohlsearch.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 3: Substitute
  :%s/old/new/g         replace in whole file
  :%s/old/new/gc        confirm each replace

Practice:
  - Try :%s/Lesson/Part/gc and answer y/n.
  - Undo when done.

End of lesson 03.
Next: :Tutor nvchad-04-visual
